# Ledger DCA Agent — Environment Variables

# No private keys are stored in this project.
# The Ledger device (or Speculos emulator) is the sole signing authority.
# This file exists to document that no env secrets are required.

# Optional: CoinGecko API key (free tier works without one)
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# Optional: Ethereum RPC URL (for live mainnet broadcasting)
# ETH_RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY